      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it is possible to overshoot if there is another primary, but not on the same primary since there is a synchronized now preventing that. The overshoot can actually be much more than one from the original plan, but no more than one from what another primary trimmed it to. I think the overshoot is OK, but if we care, we could document that trimming is an approximate process.",
